<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto/0.3.0> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> _:genid1 .
_:genid1 <https://schema.org/url> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8851-8602> .
_:genid1 <https://schema.org/name> "Marcos Daniel Zárate" .
_:genid1 <https://schema.org/affiliation> "CESIMAR-CONICET, Puerto Madryn, Argentina" .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Person> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BiodivRisk-Onto provides a formal OWL 2 DL representation of the semantic relations between four international biodiversity risk disclosure frameworks — TNFD, CSRD/ESRS E4, SBTN and GRI 101 — with particular attention to the data gaps arising from GBIF/OBIS sampling bias in Latin America and the Caribbean (LAC)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Framework concepts intentionally use OWL 2 punning: the same IRI may denote a class for subsumption axioms and an individual for concept-level alignment relations. These interpretations remain semantically distinct under OWL 2 DL."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Version 0.3.0 extends the core taxonomy with organizational, geographic and evaluation modules, explicit information-loss records, and populated instances from the Santander Peru and CEBDS Brazil case studies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-09-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BiodivRisk-Onto: An Ontology for Semantic Alignment of Biodiversity Risk Disclosure Frameworks"@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "bro" .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#" .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Version 0.3.0 — structural release adding explicit information-loss records, ordered sector priorities and biome links, while removing redundant or unused modelling elements."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/marcosdzarate/biorisk-ai> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/marcosdzarate/biorisk-ai/tree/main/ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#priorVersion> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto/0.2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.3.0" .
