<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataGap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Gap"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataSufficiencyAssessment
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataSufficiencyAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
