<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataSufficiencyAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An evaluation of whether available biodiversity data from sources such as GBIF and OBIS are sufficient to meet the information requirements of a given disclosure framework for a specific biome, sector and location. Quantifies data gaps arising from geographic and taxonomic sampling bias."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataSufficiencyAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Sufficiency Assessment"@en .
