<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#TaxonomicSamplingBias> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#TaxonomicSamplingBias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DataGap> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#TaxonomicSamplingBias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Systematic over-representation of certain taxonomic groups (e.g. birds, vascular plants) in open biodiversity databases."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#TaxonomicSamplingBias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Taxonomic Sampling Bias"@en .
