<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#WaterStressRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical risk arising from insufficient availability or quality of freshwater resources, particularly relevant for mining and agricultural sectors in the Andes. Identified as material dependency in the Santander Peru LEAP assessment (L2)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#WaterStressRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Water Stress Risk"@en .
