<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Amazonia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Largest tropical rainforest biome globally. Under-sampled in GBIF particularly for invertebrates and cryptic taxa. Relevant to both Santander Peru and CEBDS Brazil cases."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Amazonia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Amazonia Biome"@en .
