<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#AndeanDataGap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Documented under-sampling of species occurrence records in GBIF for the tropical Andes biome, including Peru. Bias towards roads, cities and protected area boundaries. Leads to false negatives in TNFD priority-location screening. Empirically documented in Santander Peru LEAP L3-L4 assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#AndeanDataGap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Andean GBIF Data Gap"@en .
