<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#AndeanWaterStressRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical risk from insufficient freshwater availability in Andean mining and agricultural operations in Peru. Identified as a material dependency in Santander Peru LEAP L2: groundwater use and protection against flooding were the most material ecosystem service dependencies. High water stress zones identified via WRI Aqueduct in LEAP L4."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#AndeanWaterStressRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Andean Water Stress Risk"@en .
