<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Cerrado> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Biome> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Cerrado> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Brazilian tropical savanna — global biodiversity hotspot under severe agricultural pressure. 67.7% increase in deforestation in 2023. Under-sampled in GBIF for its specific endemic species."@en .
