<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CerradoDataGap> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GeographicSamplingBias> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CerradoDataGap> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#affectsBiome> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#Cerrado> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CerradoDataGap> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#affectsFramework> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ESRS_E4> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CerradoDataGap> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#affectsFramework> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#TNFD> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CerradoDataGap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Documented under-sampling of species occurrence records in GBIF for the Cerrado biome, particularly invertebrates and endemic species. Documented in the CEBDS Brazil LEAP pilot as a challenge for L4 sensitive site identification."@en .
