# 
# https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#BiodiversityDataSource> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exploring Natural Capital Opportunities, Risks and Exposure — sector-level tool for screening nature-related impacts and dependencies. Uses a quantitative scale (3-9). Used in L2 by both Santander Peru and CEBDS Brazil."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ENCORE Tool"@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREData> <https://schema.org/url> <https://encorenature.org> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#QuantitativeMaterialityScale> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#hasInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#incommensurableWith> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GRI101ImpactMateriality> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ENCORE scores impacts and dependencies on a numerical scale: very low=3, low=4.5, medium=6, high=7.5, very high=9. Used by TNFD for sector-level screening."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ENCORE Quantitative Materiality Scale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ENCORE applies a quantitative composite scale (3-9) aggregating dependencies and impacts by production process. GRI 101 applies qualitative impact materiality requiring stakeholder-informed severity assessment. The two approaches operate at different epistemic levels and use incompatible measurement units."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#hasBridgingCondition> "A lossy approximation is admissible if ENCORE sector scores are supplemented with qualitative stakeholder evidence meeting GRI 101 impact severity criteria. The numerical scale (3-9) cannot be directly compared with GRI qualitative thresholds without explicit bridging assumptions documented per sector."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#InformationLoss> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#sourceConcept> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREMateriality> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#targetConcept> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GRI101ImpactMateriality> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Converting ENCORE numerical sector scores to GRI 101 impact materiality loses the original 3–9 quantitative scale, production-process aggregation and direct comparability between scored dependencies and impacts."@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ENCORE to GRI 101 Information Loss"@en .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#ENCOREtoGRIInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#hasBridgingCondition> "Supplement ENCORE scores with stakeholder evidence and severity criteria required by GRI 101; do not interpret the numerical thresholds as equivalent to qualitative materiality judgements."@en .
# 
