<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GICS> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#hasInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CIIUtoGICSInformationLoss> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GICS> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#hasInformationLoss> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CNAEtoGICSInformationLoss> .
