<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GICS> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#incommensurableWith> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#CNAE> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GICS> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "International sector classification used by ENCORE and TNFD for materiality assessment."@en .
