# https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GRI101
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GRI101> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#GRI101> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/biodivrisK-onto#DisclosureFramework> .
